{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Progress (lane 04f1, worktree epic-04f1-facade at 3beb7e4ad23). Census on this base matched the plan exactly (84 unannotated, 61 repo_root, same 23 others). Red test first: test_library_facade_annotations.py failed with 84, now passes. Annotation table applied as written, with these deviations, each forced by `make typecheck` once params stopped being Any:\n1. `attach_commits.commits` is `Sequence[str | dict[str, Any]]`, not `list[...]`: list is invariant and two callers pass `list[str]` (`_commands/attach_commits.py:33`, `_mcp_writes.py:129`). The body only iterates. Fixed in the facade, no caller edits.\n2. Sinks typed narrower than the new union (`_commands` export/import `str | Path | None`; `llm.workflow.runs.run/status/result` and `gates._clarity_threshold` `str | None`) get `None if repo_root is None else os.fspath(repo_root)` at the 6 facade call sites. Behaviour is the same for str callers; PathLike callers now pass a str.\n3. Out-of-scope file touched: `src/rebar/_mcp_reads.py` bridge_preview built `**kwargs: dict[str, list[str]]`, which mypy now rejects against the typed `repo_root`. Now calls `rebar.bridge_preview(only=only, exclude=exclude)` (the defaults are None, so this is equivalent).\n4. Out-of-scope test touched: `tests/interfaces/facades/test_bridge_programmatic_heldout.py` pins `str(inspect.signature(...))` for 7 bridge functions with `repo_root=None`; strings updated to the annotated spelling.\n5. The `repo_root` replacement also annotates 6 non-public `repo_root=None` defs in the same modules (overload stubs and private helpers), keeping each module uniform.\n6. The census test undoes the unit conftest's autouse `append_session_log` stub through the test's own monkeypatch (an autouse fixture would add a mechanism).\ngen_api_surface --check, check_mcp_library_parity, complexity, mechanism, lint, typecheck all green. File impact needs the two extra files before close."},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1792374565975363262,"uuid":"9a10ccf2-f426-4fdb-a71a-e1833fa356bb"}